    "dataAnalyticsBusinessContext": "HR and Finance leadership lacked an integrated diagnostic linking staffing distribution, upcoming age-50 retirements, KPI gaps, and payroll efficiency across 11 divisions. Without statistical validation, bonus rules and contract workforce interventions risked misallocating budget and overlooking critical succession gaps.",
