        "metricLabel": "High-Spend Tier CPA",
        "title": "Severe Diminishing Returns Above $50 Spend",
        "description": "Ads spending over $50 absorbed 85.00% ($49,899.35) of total budget for 61.72% of approved outcomes at $74.92 CPA, 8.69x higher than Low-tier ($0.01-$10) ads at $8.62 CPA.",
