    "projectBackground": "Educational teams and corporate academies often struggle with fragmented tools for hosting lessons, administering timed quizzes, tracking assignment revisions, and verifying completion credentials. EduSphere consolidates these workflows into an auditable, self-hostable platform backed by transactional database rules.",
