        "title": "Stateless-Free Cookie Auth, CSRF Guard & Rate Limiter",
        "description": "RequestGuard enforces `X-EduSphere: 1` headers and exact `APP_URL` Origin checks on all mutating HTTP methods while rate-limiting `/api/auth/` to 20 requests per minute per IP alongside `HttpOnly` `SameSite=Strict` session cookies.",
