    "projectDescription": "HireConnect is a full-stack recruitment platform built with ASP.NET Core, Angular, and PostgreSQL. It streamlines job discovery, multi-stage candidate pipelines, private PDF CV vaults, immutable application snapshots, timezone-aware interview scheduling, and administrative moderation.",
    "architectureSummary": "Angular SPA served via Nginx reverse proxy to an ASP.NET Core Minimal API backed by PostgreSQL, private PDF storage, and a transactional email outbox worker.",
