    "projectDescription": "This project builds an auditable SQL risk scoring pipeline over 6,819 Taiwanese corporate financial records. Using percentile rankings across five financial pillars without target leakage, it segments bankruptcy concentration and powers an interactive credit watchlist dashboard.",
