      "conclusion": "Combining eight empirical risk signals into a composite triage tier captures 63.62% of fraud cases and 83.44% of fraud credit exposure within 17.42% of application volume. Paired with expansion-limit controls and monthly drift monitoring in Power BI, organizations can target high-risk queues without adding review friction."
