    "dataAnalyticsBusinessContext": "Institutional investors and credit analysts monitoring Turkish public companies often evaluate bankruptcy scores and audit opinions in isolation. Fragmented risk signals and duplicate KAP filings mask early warnings where financial distress, negative equity, and reporting delays precede modified audit opinions.",
