        "metricLabel": "2013-2016 Volume Growth",
        "title": "Rapid Volume Expansion & Q3-Q4 Seasonal SLA Strain",
        "description": "Annual complaints rose from 26,495 in 2013 to 42,916 in 2016, peaking in September-October 2016 (4,611 and 4,252 cases) when national Timely Response Rate fell from >99.3% to 91.20%.",
        "impactTag": "Capacity & Seasonality"
