    "projectDescription": "An end-to-end credit analytics study examining 7,805 corporate rating observations across 686 issuers and 16 financial ratios. By deduplicating 2,694 unique financial snapshots, it quantifies Investment Grade drivers, BBB downgrade risks, agency notch bias, and GroupKFold classification accuracy.",
    "architectureSummary": "Raw CSV (7,805 rows) -> Python Cleaning & MD5 Snapshot Deduplication (2,694 unique snapshots) -> Non-Parametric Tests & GroupKFold Benchmark -> FastAPI + Next.js Interactive Dashboard",
