          "title": "Implement BBB Fallen-Angel Early Warning Triggers",
          "action": "Monitor BBB and BBB- issuers where Pre-Tax Profit Margin falls below 8% or Long-term Debt / Capital exceeds 0.45 across two consecutive quarters for proactive risk review.",
          "priority": "HIGH"
