      "variablesCount": "99 Raw Attributes (83 Transformed Columns)",
      "description": "Five annual Utah HMDA CSV extracts covering 1,067 unique reporting institutions (LEIs) across all 29 Utah counties, structured into 933,105 funded originations, 165,278 secondary-market purchases, and 1,126,395 underwriting decisions."
