    "dataAnalyticsBusinessContext": "Across 30,000 retail credit card accounts, 6,636 cardholders (22.12%) defaulted next month, exposing 863.4M in credit limits. Risk and collections teams need clear behavioral early-warning drivers to prioritize outreach before accounts roll into severe delinquency.",
