    "projectDescription": "SurveyHub is a full-stack survey and form builder platform powered by a Go REST API, Vue 3 TypeScript SPA, and dual SQLite/PostgreSQL storage. It supports multi-workspace RBAC, nine question types, immutable version snapshots, idempotent submissions, analytics, and async exports.",
