          "title": "Execute via Playground or Gateway",
          "description": "Requests pass RBAC, schema validation, Redis Lua enforcement, and DNS-pinned TLS dialing or persistent demo:// collection handlers.",
          "actorOrNode": "Go Execution Engine"
